        rdfs:label "Raup shell coiling morphospace — Parameter expressivity: 25/100" ;
        rdfs:comment "W and D act as expected; T does not act at all. Evidence: create_raup_animations.py L46–L46: T enters only via zc = T*theta <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/f3fe478/create_raup_animations.py#L46-L46>." ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
